            "sid": "NEH 13:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngaboisa mipango ereda mafunyo gha mbande kwa ngelo yaro na mafunyo gha matunda gha imbiri. Kunikumbuke na kunibonyera mecha ee Mlungu wapo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.31",
